# 以下规则是兜底，防止误拷贝进来。
workspace/
workspaces/
ws/
data/
raw/
exports/
sandboxes/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
speakers.json
!examples/speakers.json
graph.json
blind_test.json
docs/chat-transcript.md
